The study page (route 'laser-study', layout sections/laser-study.html). 'chapters' is a list: each has an 'id', a 'title' and a 'text' (the easy version) and may have 'deeper' with its own 'title' and 'text' (the full version, shown by the 'Dig deeper' button; leave 'deeper' out and the button goes too). In a text, an empty line (

) starts a new paragraph, **two stars** make words bold, and a formula is LaTeX between dollar signs: $E = h
u$ inside a sentence, or $$ … $$ as a paragraph of its own. In JSON every backslash of LaTeX is written twice (\frac). Keep the formulas of 'hy' and 'en' the same. A formula must stay on one line and hold no ** or [..](..) (the page finds it only inside one piece of text). A link to another chapter is [chapter 9](#chapter-ruby): # then chapter- then that chapter's id. The Armenian is a first translation, to be read by a fluent speaker.
